{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" turns each record into one log entry at the level you choose, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"info"},{"text":" by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default. The message is the event’s name. The metadata holds the event’s description under","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"text":", the time it was tracked under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event.timestamp"},{"text":", its call site under OpenTelemetry’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"text":" names, and every value of its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":" under the value’s key name. The entry’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own file, function and line are the event’s call site, so a handler that prints them points at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"text":" call rather than at this module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use it to see what is tracked beside the rest of your logs, in development or in a log pipeline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you already run. It writes the event’s description, in which a "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property prints as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"<redacted>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". To add events to traces instead, use "},{"code":"SpanEventDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"TracingDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" module; to send them to a server, "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"code":"HTTPDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: LoggerDestination(logger: logger, level: .debug)",")","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The umbrella guide on this area is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/loggingdestinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Destinations","title":"Destinations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"LoggingDestinations"}],"externalID":"LoggingDestinations","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"LoggingDestinations"},"abstract":[{"text":"A destination that writes each tracked event to a swift-log ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Logger"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://LoggingDestinations/documentation/LoggingDestinations/LoggerDestination":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LoggerDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"abstr